    "note": "Same day, same machine, same harness; runs were sequential (not interleaved), so differences under ~30% are noise. v1.16.2 from detached worktree 176036b, v1.17.0 column is the build BEFORE the fix (4c4b311). Cause: isProtectedPath in lib/workspace.ts recomputed and re-canonicalised snapshot roots on every call. Fix: canonical protected roots cached for 2 s, keyed by data dir, workspace and snapshot env vars.",
